sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant APIG as Gateway
    participant LF as Lambda
    participant B as Bedrock (cohere.command-text-v14)
    participant CW as CloudWatch

    U->>APIG: { "defect_text": "..." }
    APIG->>LF: Invoke (AWS_PROXY)
    LF->>B: InvokeModel (Cohere Command)
    B-->>LF: { "generations": [{ "text": "..." }] }
    LF-->>APIG: 200 { "summary": "..." }
    APIG-->>U: 200 { "summary": "..." }

    LF->>CW: structured log (request_id, latency_ms)
    Note over CW: dashboard widgets: invocations, errors, throttles
    Note over APIG: throttling 100 RPS, burst 200
    Note over LF: IAM allow bedrock:InvokeModel on model ARN (not "*")